            "value" : "For time (9 min cap):\n• 21 Deadlifts (102kg)\n• 21 Handstand Push-ups\n• 15 Deadlifts\n• 15 HSPU\n• 9 Deadlifts\n• 9 HSPU\n\nIf completed within the cap:\n• 21 Deadlifts (143kg)\n• 50-ft Handstand Walk\n• 15 Deadlifts\n• 50-ft Handstand Walk\n• 9 Deadlifts\n• 50-ft Handstand Walk"
